# The server sent CHGame_Emulator.wasm as text/plain. Browsers then refuse
# to compile it while it downloads (WebAssembly.instantiateStreaming wants
# application/wasm) and fall back to downloading it whole first, with an
# error in the console. tools/make_web.sh copies this file into build_web/,
# and the games site's tools/build_site.py beside its copy of the emulator.
AddType application/wasm .wasm
